    "turn_text": "There's no question that big government and higher taxes are in the saddle in Washington DC right now. I think it's absolutely essential this year and in two and a half years that we turn our country back to what in the Trump administration we prove works. When you let people and businesses keep more of what they earn, When you get regulations out of the way, when you unleash American energy, when you make the right investments in border security and national security, and you uphold the rule of law by appointing strong conservatives, take three steps back. America happens. I mean, seven million good paying jobs. We had the lowest unemployment ever recorded for African Americans and Hispanic Americans. literally saw the lowest unemployment for women in 60 years. I mean, the American dream was working for every American. And I was humbled to be a part of an administration that advanced those policies, but really it's just a tribute to the resilience and the character and the can do spirit of the American people. And we get the right policies again. in our nation's capital. I know we'll get it all back. I know that you",
